# "Name Sticker" Goblin: "if it's on the battlefield and you control 9 or fewer ..." is an intervening if, checked when the
# ability would trigger and again as it resolves (CR 603.4). Bot1 casts the Goblin, the trigger goes on the stack, and
# Bot1 Lightning Bolts its own Goblin in response: the condition no longer holds on resolution, so no die is rolled
# and no mana is added.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
"Name Sticker" Goblin
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x3
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

